MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6b150d71335989a41acd6479095b721b, type: 3}
  m_Name: FinalGlazerDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  entries:
  - speaker: ???
    text: What...? How did the lot of you make it this far?
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: We followed your magical power... why wouldn't we, when everything is on
      the line?
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Maya
    text: 'We must destroy the Malevolence here and now. And you shall not get in
      our way, ???. '
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: ???
    text: I had a feeling that this would happen.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: ???
    text: The four of you have been guided here by the damned fool that calls himself
      a god. Walking along his path of so-called virtue, you aim to destroy the Malevolence
      and allow your world to fall to ruin. That... I cannot let happen. He MUST
      rise again... no matter the cost.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kiri
    text: You'd give away your life for the end of the world?!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: ???
    text: You do not know the pain that this accursed world has granted me. You are
      all but mere children... there is nothing that you could possibly understand!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: Even so...
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ren
    text: We love our home... and it isn't your right to put your grubby little hands
      on it!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: ???
    text: Then, TRY ME!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: ???
    text: TRY ME, BOY! TRY TO OVERCOME THAT WHICH LIES BEYOND YOUR FEEBLE UNDERSTANDING!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
